        <detaileddescription>
<para>Private method used by <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_t_r_i_a_n_g_l_e___interface_1ae897c63afc42e1443c7c26b4745030d7" kindref="member">ReadTriangle2DMesh()</ref>. This function flags the boundaries of the Mesh using the enum <ref refid="group___c_s_m_pglobal_enums_1ga8e4421c3cd02f67e535bceb2dc74bfb6" kindref="member">BOX_BOUNDARY</ref>. For this purpose, missing neighbor elements which are flagged -1 in the &apos;.neigh&apos; file are used as indicator for elements which lie at the model boundary. <linebreak/>
</para>
<para>Is used when a 2D mesh created with the Triangle mesher is read from file. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
