        <detaileddescription>
<para>Private method used by <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_t_r_i_a_n_g_l_e___interface_1ae897c63afc42e1443c7c26b4745030d7" kindref="member">ReadTriangle2DMesh()</ref>.</para>
<para>Nodes are flagged according to their parent faces across which the face- vert vectors point. Thus, nodes 2,3 correspond to facevert 1, nodes 3,1 to facevert 2, and nodes 1,2 to facevert 3. The method does not identify corner points of the model. This task is left to FlagCornerNodes(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
